  "text": {
    "intro": "Nobody at WPKX has met anyone on the overnight schedule, which is how the station likes it.\nFive hosts are involved. Determine each host's slot, show, format and sponsor.\n- **Host**: Gideon Park, Bea Okonjo, Maribel Sosa, Rusty Lamarr and Arlo Finch.\n- **Running order** (listed from earlier to later): slot one, slot two, slot three, slot four and slot five.\n- **Show**: The Sleepless Hour; Signal Fade; The Long Haul; Owls Calling; and Coffee and Regrets.\n- **Format**: forgotten soul, trucker country, lost surf rock, radio plays and obscure jazz.\n- **Sponsor**: a taxidermist, a mattress warehouse, a storage facility, a bail bondsman and a chain of car washes.\nEvery host has a different slot, show, format and sponsor, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
