      "The host who plays radio plays and Maribel Sosa are exactly two slots apart in slot order.",
      "The host who plays radio plays and the host who presents Signal Fade are exactly one slot apart in slot order, in one direction or the other.",
      "Arlo Finch is earlier than the host who presents Signal Fade in slot order. Gideon Park and the host who presents Signal Fade both sit at odd-numbered slots or both at even-numbered slots.",
      "The host who presents The Long Haul falls somewhere between the host who plays forgotten soul and the host who plays lost surf rock in slot order, matching neither.",
      "The host who is sponsored by a taxidermist is earlier than the host who presents The Sleepless Hour in slot order. The host who plays trucker country is not sponsored by a taxidermist.",
      "At least one of the following holds, and possibly more than one: (a) Maribel Sosa is earlier than the host who is sponsored by a storage facility in slot order. (b) Rusty Lamarr and the host who is sponsored by a storage facility are exactly three slots apart in slot order.",
